{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1096184-rekindling-the-thrill","id":1096184,"title":"Rekindling the thrill","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-23T23:44:10-07:00","id":1096184,"title":"Rekindling the thrill","content":"So TL;DR due to a shift change at work I haven't been able to find the time to attend my weekly gaming group for about 6 months. I've tried playing on discord but I'm really not feeling it, nor am I really missing playing tabletop rpgs in general. Should I just pack up my books and sell them at the local half priced books?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-24T00:09:39-07:00","id":1096190,"title":"","content":"Find other weekly RPG group? There are people running in other time slots in any middle to large city.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-24T00:13:12-07:00","id":1096191,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1096184-rekindling-the-thrill?p=1096190#post1096190\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Find other weekly RPG group? There are people running in other time slots in any middle to large city.</div> </div> </div> </div>See I would but I work in the 5:30pm to 4 am shift.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-24T00:56:56-07:00","id":1096197,"title":"","content":"I haven't had a reliable gaming group in over two years and have never really had a good one; unfortunately, this happens. You said Discord wasn't for you, but I'd still suggest trying a few games through Roll20; you odd hours means you can probably game with a European or Australian group of some sort.<br /> <br /> But even if you can't find games, I'd keep your books. The main way I cope is listening to copious amounts of roleplaying-related podcasts, to live vicariously through and to absorb ideas and advice for when I finally do get to game. There's some really lovely ones out there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}